{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XAWdseKzvf5wqBnru3z3qp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_10/projects/provenance_weight_training/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| grid_b_low_seed42 | Grid-b extension to b<0.5 (b=0.1/0.2/0.3 serial), seed42, confirming whether grid-best lies at b=0.5 or below | — | — | — |\\\\n| grid_b5_0_seed456 | Grid-b weighting with b=5.0, seed=456, for multi-seed validation of best-b baseline | — | — | — |\\\\n| grid_b3_0_seed456 | Grid-b weighting with b=3.0, seed=456, for multi-seed validation of best-b baseline | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- detector_modernbert: ModernBERT-base can distinguish Qwen3-0.6B synthetic text from FineWeb human text with AUC>=0.95 and ECE<=0.05（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- adaptive_v2_seed456: Adaptive v2 (n_min fix: 3→2, no EMA) maintains or improves seed456 performance (baseline adaptive PPL=17.64)（准备中）\\\\n- adaptive_v2_seed123: Adaptive v2 (n_min fix: 3→2, no EMA) maintains or improves seed123 performance (baseline adaptive PPL=17.63)（准备中）\\\\n- adaptive_v2_seed42: Adaptive v2 (n_min fix: 3→2, no EMA) fixes ESS clamping issue, achieves meaningful improvement over uniform baseline for seed=42（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **grid_b1_5_seed456** (success): Grid-b weighting with b=1.5, seed=456, for multi-seed validation of best-b baseline\\\\n- **grid_b1_0_seed456** (success): Grid-b weighting with b=1.0, seed=456, for multi-seed validation of best-b baseline\\\\n- **grid_b0_5_seed456** (success): Grid-b weighting with b=0.5, seed=456, for multi-seed validation of best-b baseline\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 21 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 22\\\\neval_holdout_tokens: 4077068 →（近 3 次 success）\\\\neval_loss: 2.8741 ↑（